WEBVTT

00:02.335 --> 00:04.337
Captioning Provided By:
Mtv networks
字幕提供者：
音乐电视网

00:04.421 --> 00:05.797
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.880 --> 00:07.424
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:07.507 --> 00:09.175
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:09.259 --> 00:12.137
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:12.220 --> 00:14.347
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:14.431 --> 00:16.349
Kids: ♪ Spongebob Squarepants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:16.433 --> 00:18.309
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:18.393 --> 00:20.228
Kids: ♪ Spongebob Squarepants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.311 --> 00:22.355
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:22.439 --> 00:24.232
Kids: ♪ Spongebob Squarepants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.315 --> 00:26.317
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:26.401 --> 00:27.527
Kids: ♪ Spongebob Squarepants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.610 --> 00:28.778
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.862 --> 00:30.238
All: ♪ Spongebob Squarepants ♪
全部：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:30.321 --> 00:32.365
♪ Spongebob Squarepants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:32.449 --> 00:34.492
♪ Spongebob Squarepants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:34.576 --> 00:37.871
Captain: ♪ Spongebob
Squarepants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:01.352 --> 01:03.980
Mm, this is how to live,
isn't it, my friend?
嗯，这就是生活，
不是吗，我的朋友？

01:04.063 --> 01:05.899
You said it, buddy.
你说过了，伙计。

01:38.473 --> 01:40.350
He's amazing.
他太棒了。

01:40.433 --> 01:41.851
I'll say.
我会说。

01:56.616 --> 01:57.951
Whoa.
哇哦。

02:08.169 --> 02:09.963
Whoo-hoo-Hoo!
呼呼呼！

02:10.046 --> 02:11.464
Who is that guy?
那个人是谁？

02:11.548 --> 02:13.299
That's Larry the Lobster.
那是龙虾拉里。

02:13.383 --> 02:15.552
He's like livin' large.
他就像生活得很大一样。

02:15.635 --> 02:17.262
What's your secret, Larry?
你的秘密是什么，拉里？

02:17.345 --> 02:20.014
Well, you gotta
take risks.
好吧，你必须
承担风险。

02:20.098 --> 02:21.224
Live on the edge.
生活在边缘。

02:26.896 --> 02:29.190
All: Ooh...
全体：哦...

02:34.529 --> 02:36.239
And you can't, uh...
而你不能，呃...

02:36.322 --> 02:37.991
And you can't...
而你不能...

02:40.743 --> 02:42.036
And you can't live
like these two.
而你却无法活下去
就像这两个。

02:42.120 --> 02:43.371
Just look at 'em.
看看他们。

02:43.454 --> 02:45.832
Spineless...
没骨气...

02:45.915 --> 02:47.083
Weak.
虚弱的。

02:48.334 --> 02:50.044
Afraid of their own shadows.
害怕自己的影子。

02:53.923 --> 02:55.633
Pathetic.
可怜的。

02:55.717 --> 02:58.303
Larry, how can
they redeem their
worthless lives?
拉里，怎么可以
他们赎回他们的
生命毫无价值？

02:58.386 --> 03:00.013
I'll tell you how?
我来告诉你怎么做？

03:00.096 --> 03:02.348
By living each day
as if it were their last.
通过过好每一天
就好像这是他们的最后一次。

03:02.432 --> 03:04.309
How do we do that?
我们该怎么做呢？

03:04.392 --> 03:06.352
By living
like me, Larry.
通过生活
像我一样，拉里。

03:06.436 --> 03:07.604
But what's that have...
但那有什么...

03:07.687 --> 03:10.356
Uh-buh-Buh-Buh.
呃，呃，呃，呃。

03:10.440 --> 03:14.235
By livin'...
like Larry.
靠着活着...
像拉里.

03:14.319 --> 03:18.114
Livin' like
Larry.
生活就像
拉里.

03:18.197 --> 03:19.616
Livin' like Larry.
像拉里一样生活。

03:21.242 --> 03:23.620
Livin' like Larry.
像拉里一样生活。

03:23.703 --> 03:26.247
Livin' like...
♪ Larry ♪
生活就像...
♪ 拉里 ♪

03:40.136 --> 03:41.512
This is bogus.
这是假的。

03:41.596 --> 03:43.014
What's that, Pat?
那是什么，帕特？

03:43.097 --> 03:45.558
Spongebob, these are
the best years of our lives
海绵宝宝，这些是
我们生命中最美好的年华

03:45.642 --> 03:47.810
and you wanna waste
them blowing bubbles?
而你想浪费
他们吹泡泡吗？

03:47.894 --> 03:49.687
We should be
living in the moment.
我们应该
活在当下。

03:49.771 --> 03:51.898
We ought to be
living like Lar...
我们应该是
像拉尔一样生活...

03:54.359 --> 03:55.818
This is it, Spongebob.
就是这样，海绵宝宝。

03:55.902 --> 03:59.739
This is where we redeem
our miserable lives.
这就是我们赎回的地方
我们悲惨的生活。

03:59.822 --> 04:01.282
It's time to start...
是时候开始了...

04:04.786 --> 04:07.664
livin' like Larry!
像拉里一样生活！

04:09.040 --> 04:10.416
Wah-hoo!
哇呼！

04:10.500 --> 04:11.751
Whoa.
哇哦。

04:15.546 --> 04:16.673
Ah-ah-Whoo!
啊啊啊呼！

04:16.756 --> 04:19.550
Wha-ha, yee-hah, hee-hee!
哇哈哈，嘿嘿嘿！

04:21.010 --> 04:22.136
Wha-hoo!
哇呼！

04:22.220 --> 04:23.930
Hey, Spongebob?
嘿，海绵宝宝？

04:24.013 --> 04:25.223
Spongebob?
海绵宝宝？

04:29.435 --> 04:31.145
I'm living like Larry.
我过着像拉里一样的生活。

04:31.229 --> 04:32.772
whoo-hoo.
呼呼。

04:35.942 --> 04:37.527
where were you, Spongebob?
海绵宝宝，你在哪里？

04:37.610 --> 04:39.278
It was awesome.
太棒了。

04:40.989 --> 04:42.699
Hey, Patrick,
where you going?
嘿，帕特里克，
你要去哪里？

04:42.782 --> 04:44.200
To live, my friend.
为了生活，我的朋友。

04:44.283 --> 04:46.619
We...are going to live.
我们……要活下去。

04:50.623 --> 04:52.583
This is gonna be
the most fun yet.
这将会是
最有趣的了。

05:15.565 --> 05:17.567
I don't know
about this, Patrick.
我不知道
关于这一点，帕特里克.

05:17.650 --> 05:19.360
You must defeat
your reason
你必须击败
你的理由

05:19.444 --> 05:21.070
before you can start...
在你开始之前...

05:25.533 --> 05:28.995
...livin' like Larry.
...像拉里一样生活。

05:29.078 --> 05:30.496
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

05:30.580 --> 05:33.082
Spongebob!
海绵宝宝！

05:33.166 --> 05:34.292
...This is it!
...就是这样！

05:41.090 --> 05:42.425
...oww!
...哇！

05:42.508 --> 05:44.427
Ahh!
啊！

05:53.519 --> 05:56.022
SpongeBob: ♪ Dee, dee-dee,
doo, Dee-dee-Dee ♪
海绵宝宝：♪ 迪伊，迪迪，
嘟，迪迪迪♪

05:56.105 --> 05:58.316
♪ Livin' like Larry ♪
♪ 像拉里一样生活 ♪

05:58.399 --> 06:00.777
♪ doo-doo, Doo-dee-Dee,
livin' like Larry ♪
♪ 杜杜，杜迪迪，
像拉里一样生活 ♪

06:07.075 --> 06:08.743
♪ Livin' like Larry ♪
♪ 像拉里一样生活 ♪

06:16.626 --> 06:18.669
come on, Spongebob,
what are you waiting for?
来吧，海绵宝宝，
你还在等什么？

06:18.753 --> 06:20.213
Let's go.
我们走吧。

06:22.757 --> 06:24.300
But Patrick,
where are we going?
但是帕特里克，
我们要去哪里？

06:24.383 --> 06:25.593
Patrick: Just you wait.
帕特里克：你等着吧。

06:25.676 --> 06:27.220
It's the ultimate.
这是终极的。

06:29.764 --> 06:31.933
What do you think?
你怎么认为？

06:33.976 --> 06:35.937
And wait'll you
see the best part.
等等你
看到最好的部分。

06:38.815 --> 06:41.317
Patrick: Hey, you guys!
帕特里克：嘿，你们！

06:44.570 --> 06:46.864
I don't know, Patrick,
this looks really dangerous...
我不知道，帕特里克，
这看起来真的很危险......

06:50.785 --> 06:53.121
Here's to livin' like Larry.
像拉里一样生活。

06:53.204 --> 06:54.747
Well, wait
a minute, Patrick.
好吧，等等
等一下，帕特里克。

06:54.831 --> 06:56.541
I think you're
missing the point.
我认为你是
没有抓住要点。

06:56.624 --> 06:58.876
Livin' like Larry doesn't mean
throwing caution to the wind
像拉里一样生活并不意味着
不顾一切

06:58.960 --> 07:02.630
and risking everything
on a stunt that will
cost you your life.
并冒着一切风险
的特技表演
让你付出了生命的代价。

07:02.713 --> 07:05.925
Uh... Don't you
mean cost us
呃...你不是吗
我们的平均成本

07:06.008 --> 07:08.469
our  lives, Spongebob?
我们的生活，海绵宝宝？

07:08.553 --> 07:10.471
No, Patrick,
I mean your life.
不，帕特里克，
我指的是你的生活。

07:10.555 --> 07:11.681
I'm not going.
我不去。

07:11.764 --> 07:13.391
Oh, I see.
我懂了。

07:13.474 --> 07:17.103
And that's your final
word on the subject?
这就是你的最终结局
关于这个主题的词？

07:17.186 --> 07:18.396
Um-hm.
嗯嗯。

07:18.479 --> 07:20.648
I feel sorry for you.
我为你感到难过。

07:20.731 --> 07:22.066
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

07:22.150 --> 07:23.818
Oh-ho-Ho!
噢-嗬-嗬！

07:37.373 --> 07:39.959
I wonder how Patrick's
doing with his livin'
like Larry thing?
我想知道帕特里克怎么样
他的生活
像拉里的事？

07:40.042 --> 07:41.460
Patrick: Spongebob?
帕特里克：海绵宝宝？

07:46.299 --> 07:47.425
Spongebob!
海绵宝宝！

07:54.891 --> 07:56.559
You were right, Spongebob.
你是对的，海绵宝宝。

07:56.642 --> 07:57.768
I went to far.
我走到了很远的地方。

07:57.852 --> 07:59.645
: I went too far!
: 我太过分了！

07:59.729 --> 08:01.689
Oh, it's ok, buddy.
哦，没关系，伙计。

08:01.772 --> 08:03.900
I think you've learned
your lesson, hm?
我想你已经学会了
你的课，嗯？

08:03.983 --> 08:05.484
: uh-huh.
: 嗯嗯。

08:05.568 --> 08:07.486
Gang Member: Don't make
us come in there, kid.
团伙成员：别做
我们进来吧，孩子。

08:07.570 --> 08:10.948
Now you just let me handle
those guys out there.
现在你让我来处理
外面的那些人。

08:13.409 --> 08:15.578
Gentlemen, gentlemen.
先生们，先生们。

08:17.288 --> 08:18.998
SpongeBob: I know that
you might be angry
海绵宝宝：我知道
你可能会生气

08:19.081 --> 08:21.292
with my friend
for his shenanigans
和我的朋友
为了他的恶作剧

08:21.375 --> 08:23.127
but you are not
the only victim.
但你不是
唯一的受害者。

08:23.211 --> 08:24.879
His reckless thrill
chasing has left him
他的鲁莽的兴奋
追逐已离他而去

08:24.962 --> 08:27.215
a hollow shell
of his former self.
一个空心的壳
他以前的自己。

08:27.298 --> 08:28.424
Just look.
看看吧。

08:29.800 --> 08:31.385
So let me assure you...
所以让我向你保证...

08:31.469 --> 08:34.680
his days of living
in the moment are over.
他的日子
此刻都结束了。

08:34.764 --> 08:37.058
...Can you not forgive him
for whatever he did?
……你能不能原谅他
无论他做了什么？

08:41.103 --> 08:45.358
Sure, pal... Sure.
当然，朋友……当然。

08:45.441 --> 08:47.985
By the way, what  did  he do
that made y'all so cranky?
顺便说一句，他做了什么
这让你们这么暴躁？

08:53.157 --> 08:55.034
He knocked over our motorcycles.
他撞翻了我们的摩托车。

08:55.117 --> 08:56.786
Bah.
呸。

09:02.625 --> 09:05.336
So scared... Adrenaline pumping.
太害怕了……肾上腺素激增。

09:05.419 --> 09:07.004
Spine tingling.
脊椎发麻。

09:07.088 --> 09:09.632
Endorphins rushing.
内啡肽涌动。

09:09.715 --> 09:13.469
I've never felt so alive!
我从来没有感觉如此充满活力！

09:13.552 --> 09:15.429
Oh, yeah, baby, yeah!
哦，是的，宝贝，是的！

09:15.513 --> 09:18.432
This is what Patrick
was talking about.
这就是帕特里克
正在谈论。

09:18.516 --> 09:20.643
This is really
living in the moment.
这真是
活在当下。

09:20.726 --> 09:22.311
Whoo-yeah!
呼-耶！

09:22.395 --> 09:24.647
This is life!
这就是生活！

09:24.730 --> 09:26.649
Whoo, whoo!
呼呼！

09:26.732 --> 09:28.901
Oh, yes, whoo!
哦，是的，哇！

09:28.985 --> 09:30.528
Now I am really
现在我真的是

09:30.611 --> 09:32.530
livin' like Larry.
像拉里一样生活。

09:32.613 --> 09:34.365
Whoa!
哇！

09:34.448 --> 09:37.118
Patrick: Are you sure
about this, Spongebob?
帕特里克：你确定吗？
关于这个，海绵宝宝？

09:37.201 --> 09:39.453
SpongeBob: Oh, come on,
Patrick, what happened
to being in the moment?
海绵宝宝：哦，来吧，
帕特里克，发生了什么事
活在当下？

09:39.537 --> 09:41.497
I don't know, Spongebob.
我不知道，海绵宝宝。

09:41.580 --> 09:43.499
This looks pretty dangerous.
这看起来相当危险。

09:43.582 --> 09:45.251
Yeah, yeah,
you said it, buddy.
是啊，是啊，
你说过了，伙计。

09:45.334 --> 09:47.378
Now we're really
livin' like Larry.
现在我们真的
像拉里一样生活。

09:51.007 --> 09:52.591
Well, will you look at that?
嗯，你会看一下吗？

09:58.180 --> 10:01.642
...Now there's two guys
who know how to live.
......现在有两个人
谁知道如何生活。

10:01.726 --> 10:02.977
Prepare for
countdown.
准备
倒计时。

10:03.060 --> 10:05.730
I'm proud of them.
我为他们感到骄傲。

10:05.813 --> 10:07.106
Wait a minute.
等一下。

10:07.189 --> 10:09.483
With that angle of trajectory
有了这个轨迹角度

10:09.567 --> 10:12.153
they'll land right in...
Ripper's Reef.
他们将立即降落在...
开膛手礁。

10:12.236 --> 10:14.280
They'll be ripped to shreds.
他们会被撕成碎片。

10:15.781 --> 10:17.950
Wait, don't do it, stop!
等等，别这样做，停下来！

10:18.034 --> 10:20.786
SpongeBob:
Three, two, one.
海绵宝宝：
三、二、一。

10:20.870 --> 10:22.288
Liftoff.
升空。

10:23.831 --> 10:25.207
Drat.
德拉特。

10:26.917 --> 10:28.711
Whoo!
呼！

10:28.794 --> 10:30.713
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

10:30.796 --> 10:32.214
...whoo-whoo-Whoo.
...呼-呼-呼。

10:36.969 --> 10:38.596
Ooh?
哦？

10:42.058 --> 10:44.977
Whoa...
哇...

10:46.562 --> 10:48.230
whoa...
哇...

10:48.314 --> 10:51.567
Look, guys, my advice wasn't
meant to be taken literally.
听着，伙计们，我的建议不是
从字面上理解。

10:51.650 --> 10:53.736
I meant to live
life to the fullest
我本来想活下去
生活充实

10:53.819 --> 10:54.945
not to maim yourselves.
不要伤害自己。

10:55.029 --> 10:56.405
Look!
看！

10:57.615 --> 10:59.033
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

11:09.251 --> 11:11.003
Ohh...
哦...

11:14.382 --> 11:17.385
Hey, what are you two
lazybones doing lying around?
嘿，你们两个是什么人
懒人躺着做什么？

11:17.468 --> 11:19.512
There's a really
cool ramp down the hall.
确实有一个
沿着大厅很酷的坡道。

11:19.595 --> 11:21.263
I got room for two more.
我还有空间容纳另外两个人。

11:21.347 --> 11:22.890
What would Larry do?
拉里会怎么做？

11:24.600 --> 11:26.685
What would Larry do?
拉里会怎么做？

11:26.769 --> 11:31.023
I'll show you what
Larry would do, come here.
我会告诉你什么
拉里就行，过来吧。

11:31.107 --> 11:32.650
...Come here,
I said.
...来这里，
我说。

11:34.610 --> 11:35.986
Larry: Hey!
拉里：嘿！

11:55.798 --> 11:57.425
Whoo, yeah.
哇，是啊。

11:57.508 --> 11:59.260
SpongeBob: ♪ La, la, la, la... ♪
海绵宝宝：♪ 啦，啦，啦，啦……♪

12:02.680 --> 12:04.432
I thought you left
your swimsuit at home?
我以为你离开了
你家里有泳衣吗？

12:04.515 --> 12:07.560
No, I just didn't want
to get it all wrinkled up.
不，我只是不想
让一切都变得皱起来。

12:07.643 --> 12:09.395
Last one in is a rotten egg.
最后一个是一个臭鸡蛋。

12:11.188 --> 12:12.857
Rotten eggs?
臭鸡蛋？

12:12.940 --> 12:14.066
: Bah...
: 呸...

12:24.326 --> 12:26.704
Honey?
蜂蜜？

12:26.787 --> 12:29.623
You're not using
that "tan accelerator"
again, are you?
你没有使用
那个“晒黑促进剂”
再说一次，你是吗？

12:29.707 --> 12:32.835
Oh, don't pretend
you don't love it.
哦，别假装
你不喜欢它。

12:39.133 --> 12:40.259
Man:
Good work, man.
男士：
干得好，伙计。

12:41.594 --> 12:42.928
...I see you've
read my book?
...我看你已经
读我的书吗？

12:43.012 --> 12:44.513
Craig Mammalton?
克雷格·马莫尔顿？

12:44.597 --> 12:46.807
The tannest man on TV?
电视上最晒黑的男人？

12:48.642 --> 12:50.186
None other.
没有别的。

12:52.855 --> 12:55.941
Oh, look at those
gorgeous wrinkles.
哦，看看那些
华丽的皱纹。

12:56.025 --> 12:57.860
What... These?
什么……这些？

13:00.154 --> 13:02.072
Oh, and his skin.
哦，还有他的皮肤。

13:02.156 --> 13:04.909
It's so leathery.
它是如此皮革。

13:04.992 --> 13:07.661
Well, I don't mean
to brag, but, uh...
嗯，我的意思不是
吹牛，但是，呃...

13:11.624 --> 13:13.834
Who's Craig mammalton?
克雷格·哺乳动物顿是谁？

13:13.918 --> 13:16.378
You don't know
who Craig mammalton is?
你不知道
克雷格·哺乳动物顿是谁？

13:16.462 --> 13:18.797
He's like  so  tan.
他晒得这么黑。

13:18.881 --> 13:21.967
...Legend has it that
his tan is so deep
...传说
他的棕褐色很深

13:22.051 --> 13:26.305
that even his bones
are a rich caramel brown.
甚至连他的骨头
是浓郁的焦糖棕色。

13:26.388 --> 13:27.848
Wow.
哇。

13:27.932 --> 13:30.351
His mother must
be  so  proud.
他的母亲必须
如此自豪。

13:30.434 --> 13:32.728
Please, people, please.
拜托了，人们，拜托了。

13:32.811 --> 13:35.314
There will be plenty of time
to admire my body this weekend
会有充足的时间
这个周末欣赏我的身体

13:35.397 --> 13:38.275
at my annual summer shindig.
在我一年一度的夏季聚会上。

13:43.739 --> 13:48.994
Wow, Patrick, an invitation
to our first summer shindig.
哇，帕特里克，邀请函
参加我们的第一次夏季聚会。

13:49.078 --> 13:51.330
And here it is.
就是这样。

13:52.790 --> 13:55.501
Can I help you
little fella?
我可以帮你吗
小家伙？

13:55.584 --> 13:57.419
It seems to be stuck.
似乎被卡住了。

13:57.503 --> 13:59.922
Yeah, I don't think
this is your type of party.
是的，我不认为
这就是您的聚会类型。

14:00.005 --> 14:02.216
I don't wanna
embarrass you guys...
我不想
让你们尴尬了……

14:02.299 --> 14:04.426
Hey, everyone,
check this out.
嘿，大家，
看看这个。

14:04.843 --> 14:07.972
...But this party is
for the pigmentally  gifted.
...但是这个聚会是
对于有颜料天赋的人来说。

14:08.055 --> 14:11.433
SpongeBob: Must be
this tan to enter.
海绵宝宝：一定是
这个晒黑进入。

14:11.517 --> 14:14.186
And your skin is as light
and smooth as a...
你的皮肤同样轻盈
并且光滑如...

14:14.270 --> 14:15.354
Well, as a baby's bottom.
嗯，就像婴儿的屁股一样。

14:19.108 --> 14:20.818
Why, thank you.
为什么，谢谢。

14:20.901 --> 14:23.904
We did put on a few extra
coats of sunscreen today.
我们确实多加了一些
今天涂了防晒霜。

14:23.988 --> 14:25.406
In fact...
实际上...

14:26.907 --> 14:28.617
It's time for another coat.
是时候再买一件外套了。

14:31.579 --> 14:33.122
We've gotta look our best.
我们必须展现出最好的一面。

14:34.373 --> 14:35.499
: Losers.
: 失败者。

14:36.959 --> 14:38.586
you're not coming to my party
你不来参加我的聚会

14:38.669 --> 14:40.129
...without a tan.
...没有晒黑。

14:45.676 --> 14:48.762
There, now that we've turned
your rock into a tanning bed
现在我们已经转向了
把你的石头变成晒黑床

14:48.846 --> 14:50.889
we're sure to get tan
enough for the party.
我们肯定会被晒黑
足够参加聚会了。

14:50.973 --> 14:53.100
Let's just test it
out first to be sure.
我们来测试一下
首先确定一下。

14:57.021 --> 14:58.355
Ooh.
哦。

15:04.445 --> 15:05.571
Hooray.
万岁。

15:07.323 --> 15:08.699
Me first,
Me first.
我先，
我先。

15:20.794 --> 15:22.504
Ooh-hoo, Patrick,
how do you feel?
哦呼，帕特里克，
你感觉怎么样？

15:22.588 --> 15:24.673
Like one of those
hip, young, old folks
就像其中之一
时髦的、年轻人的、老年人的

15:24.757 --> 15:26.925
from a soda commercial.
来自苏打水广告。

15:27.009 --> 15:28.135
It's radical.
这是激进的。

15:30.095 --> 15:31.221
Radical.
激进的。

15:32.598 --> 15:33.974
Drink it.
喝吧。

15:34.058 --> 15:35.643
My turn.
轮到我了。

15:38.520 --> 15:41.106
Remember, Patrick,
15 seconds exactly.
请记住，帕特里克，
正好15秒。

15:41.190 --> 15:42.691
Got ya.
明白了。

15:42.775 --> 15:45.027
15 seconds give or
take a few minutes.
15 秒给或
需要几分钟。

15:45.110 --> 15:46.236
No-no, Patrick!
不，不，帕特里克！

15:46.320 --> 15:47.655
15 seconds exactly.
正好15秒。

15:47.738 --> 15:49.156
It's really important...
这真的很重要...

15:53.077 --> 15:54.828
It's working.
它正在发挥作用。

16:00.459 --> 16:02.127
Ok, Patrick, I'm done.
好吧，帕特里克，我完成了。

16:02.211 --> 16:04.088
Patrick...  Patrick?
帕特里克……帕特里克？

16:04.171 --> 16:05.881
Are you there?
你在吗？

16:05.964 --> 16:07.299
...Patrick?
...帕特里克？

16:07.383 --> 16:08.842
What?
什么？

16:08.926 --> 16:11.053
Did somebody say something? Hm.
有人说了些什么吗？嗯。

16:11.136 --> 16:12.805
Girls:  :
Hey, there.
女孩：：
嘿，在那里。

16:12.888 --> 16:14.890
Is that tan
for us?
那是晒黑的吗
对我们来说？

16:14.973 --> 16:16.183
What?
什么？

16:18.894 --> 16:20.562
SpongeBob: Uh, Patrick?
海绵宝宝：呃，帕特里克？

16:20.646 --> 16:22.815
It's time for me to get out.
我该出去了。

16:25.234 --> 16:27.069
French Man: Two hours later.
法国人：两个小时后。

16:27.152 --> 16:29.905
Girls:   Ohh...
女孩们：哦……

16:29.988 --> 16:31.490
Do you really
have to go, Patrick?
你真的吗
得走了，帕特里克？

16:31.573 --> 16:32.908
Afraid so.
恐怕是这样。

16:32.991 --> 16:34.118
Bye, girls.
再见，女孩们。

16:34.201 --> 16:36.328
All: Bye, Pat.
全体：再见，帕特。

16:36.412 --> 16:38.706
Girl: Oh, he's
so leathery.
女孩：哦，他是
如此皮革般。

16:47.423 --> 16:49.508
Well, Patrick, how do I look?
好吧，帕特里克，我看起来怎么样？

16:49.591 --> 16:50.926
Patrick: Ahh!
帕特里克：啊！

16:52.219 --> 16:54.346
Oh, it's you.
哦，是你。

16:54.430 --> 16:57.224
You don't look too good.
你看起来不太好。

16:57.307 --> 16:59.143
What, what,
what do you mean?
什么，什么，
你是什么意思？

16:59.226 --> 17:00.352
See for yourself.
你自己看看吧。

17:01.937 --> 17:04.356
I must've been under
the tanning machine too long.
我一定是在
晒黑机时间太长。

17:06.942 --> 17:08.652
Ew, what are
you gonna do?
呃，什么是
你要做什么？

17:08.736 --> 17:09.862
I'll ask Squidward.
我去问问章鱼哥。

17:09.945 --> 17:11.238
He's always so helpful.
他总是那么乐于助人。

17:11.321 --> 17:13.365
He'll know what to do.
他会知道该怎么做。

17:13.449 --> 17:15.325
SpongeBob:
Hi, Squidward.
海绵宝宝：
嗨，章鱼哥。

17:15.409 --> 17:17.536
What is it now sponge... Ahh!
现在海绵是什么……啊！

17:17.619 --> 17:19.329
Ghost!
鬼！

17:19.413 --> 17:22.374
I'm sorry I was so mean to
you while you were alive.
抱歉我太刻薄了
你活着的时候。

17:22.458 --> 17:24.042
Please don't haunt me.
请不要困扰我。

17:24.126 --> 17:25.753
Oh, I'm not a ghost, Squidward.
哦，我不是幽灵，章鱼哥。

17:25.836 --> 17:27.880
: Bah...
: 呸...

17:27.963 --> 17:30.883
I used Patrick's tanning booth
and I stayed under too long.
我用过帕特里克的晒黑亭
我在水下呆得太久了。

17:30.966 --> 17:32.760
: Ha,
ha, ha, ha, ha.
：哈，
哈哈哈。

17:32.843 --> 17:35.220
Oh, this is
too precious.
哦，这是
太珍贵了。

17:35.304 --> 17:37.389
You're sun bleached.
你被太阳晒白了。

17:39.641 --> 17:42.352
Looks like you won't
be at the party.
看来你不会
参加聚会。

17:44.438 --> 17:46.064
Squidward: Ha,
ha, ha, ha.
章鱼哥：哈，
哈哈哈。

17:46.148 --> 17:48.233
Sun bleached.
太阳晒白了。

17:50.152 --> 17:52.738
Now I'll never get
into that party.
现在我永远也得不到
进入那个聚会。

17:52.821 --> 17:54.907
Hey, that's
quitter talk, mister.
嘿，那是
放弃谈话，先生。

17:54.990 --> 17:56.742
You're going to
that party tonight.
你将会
今晚的那个聚会。

17:56.825 --> 17:58.118
What you need...
你需要什么...

17:58.202 --> 17:59.828
is a makeover.
是一次改头换面。

18:06.251 --> 18:09.671
Hmm... Hm.
嗯……嗯。

18:12.841 --> 18:14.259
A little kelp jerky?
一点海带干？

18:15.761 --> 18:17.179
Open wide.
敞开。

18:18.764 --> 18:20.682
SpongeBob: Ah, ah?
海绵宝宝：啊啊？

18:27.898 --> 18:29.233
What do you think?
你怎么认为？

18:31.360 --> 18:34.446
I look...  Amazing.
我看起来……太棒了。

18:34.530 --> 18:36.323
Time to go to the party.
是时候去参加聚会了。

18:39.785 --> 18:42.412
Aw, what a cute
"wittle" baby.
噢，多么可爱啊
“机灵”宝宝。

18:42.496 --> 18:44.206
Coochie coochie...
库奇库奇...

18:46.375 --> 18:49.086
Ah, you...
啊，你...

18:50.796 --> 18:52.381
Well, hey, buddy.
嗯，嘿，伙计。

18:52.464 --> 18:54.132
You look like you
could use an ice cream.
你看起来像你
可以用冰淇淋。

19:02.850 --> 19:05.018
Oh, yeah, that hit the spot.
哦，是的，这恰到好处。

19:05.102 --> 19:07.020
Patrick: One carmel
sundae, please.
帕特里克：一卡梅尔
圣代，请。

19:09.731 --> 19:12.985
Oh, I think you'll
have to go to the
party without me, Patrick.
哦，我想你会
必须去
没有我的派对，帕特里克。

19:13.068 --> 19:16.280
There's just no way I can get
that Golden Brown in time.
我就是没有办法得到
及时的金棕色。

19:16.363 --> 19:20.200
But that's no reason
you shouldn't go... Ow!
但这不是理由
你不应该去……噢！

19:20.284 --> 19:21.994
Patrick,
why did you...
帕特里克，
你为什么...

19:22.077 --> 19:23.704
No, really, Patrick,
why did you...
不，真的，帕特里克，
你为什么...

19:26.290 --> 19:27.416
Ugh, I feel sticky.
呃，我感觉很粘。

19:27.499 --> 19:28.917
Take a look.
看看吧。

19:30.294 --> 19:31.670
Whoo!
呼！

19:31.753 --> 19:34.339
Thanks,
Patrick...
谢谢，
帕特里克...

19:34.423 --> 19:36.008
Uh, I'm stuck.
呃，我被困住了。

19:45.559 --> 19:46.685
Craig: Nice job, ma'am.
克雷格：干得好，女士。

19:46.768 --> 19:48.020
Join the party.
加入聚会。

19:48.103 --> 19:49.771
Ahem, but, uh...
咳咳，但是，呃...

19:49.855 --> 19:51.940
The baby's gonna
have to wait outside.
宝宝会的
必须在外面等待。

19:52.024 --> 19:54.026
But he's the perfect shade
of "tropical toddler".
但他是完美的阴影
“热带幼儿”。

19:55.319 --> 19:56.820
Yes, but...
是的，但是……

19:57.779 --> 20:00.574
Tyler, how could you?
泰勒，你怎么可以？

20:00.657 --> 20:02.201
Now don't worry, ma'am.
现在不用担心，女士。

20:02.284 --> 20:04.202
He can wait out here
with the other rejects.
他可以在这里等
与其他拒绝。

20:06.496 --> 20:08.540
Oh, no tears, son,
we'll get in next year.
哦，没有眼泪，儿子，
我们明年就会进去。

20:08.624 --> 20:10.083
Next?
下一个？

20:10.167 --> 20:12.044
Hey, hey...
: Hey-hey-Hey.
嘿嘿...
: 嘿嘿嘿。

20:12.127 --> 20:13.795
Looks like you
two took my advice.
看起来像你
两个接受了我的建议。

20:13.879 --> 20:15.213
Nice job, gentlemen
干得好，先生们

20:15.297 --> 20:17.674
Come on in.
进来吧。

20:22.054 --> 20:24.681
Craig: All right,
party people.
克雷格：好吧，
党的人。

20:24.765 --> 20:26.808
It's time to
roll out the portables.
是时候了
推出便携式设备。

20:46.161 --> 20:49.122
Oh, no,
caramel hardening.
哦，不，
焦糖硬化。

20:49.206 --> 20:51.416
Got to get out of here.
必须离开这里。

20:53.043 --> 20:54.753
Patrick?
帕特里克？

20:54.836 --> 20:56.088
What?
什么？

20:56.171 --> 20:57.506
Can I get a little
help here?
我可以得到一点吗
在这里帮忙？

20:57.589 --> 20:58.924
Oh, sure thing, pal.
哦，当然可以，朋友。

20:59.007 --> 21:00.842
Hey, everybody,
make some room.
嘿，大家，
腾出一些空间。

21:00.926 --> 21:02.761
The floor's all yours.
地板都是你的了。

21:02.844 --> 21:04.429
Knock 'em dead, kid.
把他们打死吧，孩子。

21:04.513 --> 21:05.639
No, Patrick, I...  .
不，帕特里克，我……

21:14.523 --> 21:15.899
So bright.
如此明亮。

21:15.983 --> 21:17.275
Honey, look away.
亲爱的，把目光移开。

21:22.948 --> 21:25.325
SpongeBob:
Eh, heh-heh.
海绵宝宝：
呃，呵呵。

21:25.409 --> 21:26.994
: Nice job.
: 干得好。

21:27.077 --> 21:28.787
Australian Fish: Your
hideously white skin
澳大利亚鱼：您的
皮肤白得可怕

21:28.870 --> 21:30.414
just ruined the party-
look at you.
刚刚毁了聚会——
看看你。

21:30.497 --> 21:32.082
...Do you hug your
mother with that skin?
...你拥抱你吗
妈妈有那种皮肤吗？

21:35.377 --> 21:38.505
Can you believe this
guy crashed your party?
你能相信吗
那家伙破坏了你的聚会？

21:38.588 --> 21:40.007
Craig?
克雷格？

21:41.049 --> 21:44.761
I have seen this
only one other time.
我见过这个
只有一次。

21:44.845 --> 21:46.555
It's the ultimate tan.
这是终极晒黑。

21:46.638 --> 21:48.056
He's...
他是...

21:49.433 --> 21:50.976
...Sun bleached.
...阳光漂白了。

21:54.563 --> 21:57.024
Sun bleached?
太阳晒白了？

21:57.107 --> 21:58.525
This young man...
这个年轻人...

21:58.608 --> 22:00.360
this young  hero
这位年轻的英雄

22:00.444 --> 22:02.863
should be praised
for his dedication
应该受到赞扬
为了他的奉献

22:02.946 --> 22:04.573
to "tan-liness."
到“晒黑”。

22:04.656 --> 22:06.491
Hooray.
万岁。

22:08.076 --> 22:09.995
If you guys are feelin' it
如果你们感觉到了

22:10.078 --> 22:12.372
we should all follow
in his footsteps.
我们都应该遵循
按照他的脚步。

22:15.083 --> 22:17.127
Craig: Frankie, crank it up.
克雷格：弗兰基，加大力度。

22:22.132 --> 22:23.967
French Man: Two hours later.
法国人：两个小时后。

22:28.096 --> 22:30.307
But Patrick,
do you think maybe
但是帕特里克，
你认为也许

22:30.390 --> 22:31.975
too much sun
is a bad thing?
太多阳光
是坏事吗？

22:34.019 --> 22:35.270
Patrick: Whatever.
帕特里克：不管怎样。

22:35.353 --> 22:37.105
I just go
with the flow.
我就走
随着流量。

我就走
随着流量。